    "changes": [
      "ln: negative nonzero inputs return a quiet NaN",
      "ln: either signed zero returns negative infinity",
      "ln: positive infinity preserved and positive NaNs quieted",
      "ln: positive subnormal significands normalized into the existing fixed-point kernel",
      "ln: omitted greedy step32, whose Q62 x increment and logarithm contributions cancel exactly",
      "ln: exact RNE near-one integer kernel for every 98,303 binary64 encoding from 1-65535*2^-53 through 1+32767*2^-52",
      "No new lookup table; sampled ordinary paths have fewer instructions"
    ]
